And I suspect that if we look at the past, we're going to find, as we have experienced this morning, a very complex picture of people, Jews and Christians, who interacted with each other, got along very well, did business, bought and sold.

cue0057689
00:59:30.740 --> 00:59:38.580
and the next week we're fighting, arguing, and bringing in a tradition of group interaction

cue0057690
00:59:38.580 --> 00:59:42.620
based on what they consider to be sacred scripture.

cue0057691
00:59:43.440 --> 00:59:49.480
The business of history is to find the best likely story.

cue0057692
00:59:50.200 --> 00:59:59.080
The business of religion is to help us experience life and God and each other in a better way.

cue0057693
00:59:59.080 --> 01:00:01.820
We thank you very much for a wonderful evening.
